# Copy to .dev.vars for local development (wrangler dev) — every value is OPTIONAL.
# With none of them set, the game runs fully in demo mode: scripted AI host,
# generated demo decks for the curator, and an in-memory leaderboard.

# AI host — Gemini adapter (https://aistudio.google.com/apikey)
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash

# AI host — OpenAI-compatible adapter (any /chat/completions endpoint)
# HOST_LLM_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# HOST_LLM_API_KEY=
# HOST_LLM_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Jev judgment model — TypeSafe (https://console.typesafe.ai)
# Gates curator candidates (Noul relevance/appropriateness + fit Choice) and
# picks the host's tone (Choice) and drama (Score). Without a key, the
# deterministic demo judge answers instead and is labelled "demo" everywhere.
# TYPESAFE_API_KEY=
# TYPESAFE_MODEL=jev-latest
# TYPESAFE_BASE_URL=https://api.typesafe.ai

# Leaderboard — Upstash Redis REST (https://console.upstash.com)
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
